---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="SMS Terms & Conditions — Ivantsov.tech"
	description="Terms and conditions for the Ivantsov personal-assistant SMS service."
>
	<Nav />
	<main class="px-6 pt-24 md:pt-36 pb-16">
		<article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6">
			<h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold">SMS Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
			<p class="text-sm opacity-[0.78]">Personal-Assistant Messaging Service — Alex Ivantsov, Sole Proprietor. Last updated: July 28, 2026.</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">1. The program</h2>
			<p>
				The Ivantsov personal-assistant messaging service sends informational
				messages — calendar and appointment reminders, task and bill-due
				notifications, schedule summaries, and conversational replies — to
				recipients who have opted in. The service is private and invite-based:
				recipients are the account owner and household members who personally
				requested it. No marketing, promotional, or third-party content is sent.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">2. Opting in</h2>
			<p>
				You opt in by requesting the service directly from Alex Ivantsov in
				person or by phone, or by texting <strong>START</strong> to the service
				number. Consent is recorded before the first message is sent. Consent is
				not a condition of any purchase.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">3. Message frequency and cost</h2>
			<p>
				Message frequency varies — typically fewer than 10 messages per day.
				<strong>Message and data rates may apply</strong> per your mobile
				carrier plan. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered
				messages.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">4. Opting out and support</h2>
			<p>
				Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to cancel at any time; one final message
				will confirm your opt-out. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or
				contact <a href="mailto:alex@ivantsov.tech" class="underline">alex@ivantsov.tech</a>.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">5. Privacy</h2>
			<p>
				Mobile numbers and consent records are never shared with or sold to
				third parties. Full details:
				<a href="/sms-privacy" class="underline">SMS Privacy Policy</a>.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4">6. Changes</h2>
			<p>
				These terms may be updated; the "last updated" date above reflects the
				current version. Continued participation after changes constitutes
				acceptance.
			</p>
		</article>
	</main>
</Layout>
